@host = http://localhost:5037

### 1. Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Test", "lastName": "User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 2. Login (the token is saved automatically for request 3)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 3. Who am I? (run request 2 first)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
